EPEN
MEMORANDUM
TO:
Governing Body, City of Cheyenne
FROM:
Renee Smith, Economic Resource Administrator
DATE:
AUGUST7,2024
SUBJECT:
GRANT AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE US DEPARTMENT OF
TRANSPORTATION FEDERAL HIGHWAY ADMINISTRATION AND THE
CHEYENNE MP OF OR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A COMPREHENSIVE
SAFETY ACTION PLAN
program to develop a comprehensive safety action plan.The Cheyenne MPO plans to engage a consultant to
perform thiswork and expects thedocument tobe available to the public in August 2026.
A comprehensive safety action planisa strategic framework aimed at reducing and eliminating serious injuries
and fatalities onroadways.These plans are essential for communities seeking to improve traffic safety and are
often a prerequisite for accessing additional federal funding opportunities.
Grant Award:$200,000; project budget $250,000 (grant match from the 6Penny Grant Match)
Please contact me orMPO's Interim Director, Chris Yaney, if you would like more information about this
grant project, rsmith@.cheyenne city.orgorcyaney@cheyenne city.org.
